<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Cartwright & Checa (2007), Cartwright et al. (2009) & BCF (1951) nacre screw-dislocation spirals, Frank-Read target loops, and chitin pore mineral-bridge columnar vs sheet transition (Haliotis rufescens (Gastropoda columnar nacre) / Pteria hirundo & Pinctada margaritifera (Bivalvia sheet nacre))",
        "Cartwright & Checa (2007), Cartwright et al. (2009) & BCF (1951) nacre screw-dislocation spirals, Frank-Read target loops, and chitin pore mineral-bridge columnar vs sheet transition faithfully reproduces Haliotis rufescens (Gastropoda columnar nacre) / Pteria hirundo & Pinctada margaritifera (Bivalvia sheet nacre) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Haliotis rufescens (Gastropoda columnar nacre) / Pteria hirundo & Pinctada margaritifera (Bivalvia sheet nacre) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 91.8/100, audit 2026-10-19-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/HEAD/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py> ;
